#: ../../../tools/lower_trace.md:160
msgid "Compilation instrumentation: `enable()` / `disable()`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/lower_trace.md:162
msgid ""
"To trace the *entire* compilation pipeline of a real kernel (what the "
"environment variable does, but programmatically):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/lower_trace.md:165
msgid ""
"from tilelang.tools import lower_trace as lt\n"
"\n"
"# Enable tracing for the rest of the process.\n"
"lt.enable(mode=\"both\")\n"
"\n"
"# ... run tilelang.compile() / kernel compilation ...\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/lower_trace.md:174
msgid ""
"All three parameters of `lt.enable()` are optional — `mode`, `trace_dir`, "
"and `codegen_output` fall back to the `TL_LOWER_TRACE` / "
"`TL_LOWER_TRACE_DIR` env vars (or sensible defaults) when omitted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tools/lower_trace.md:0
msgid ""
"Force a trace mode: `\"terminal\"`, `\"html\"`, `\"both\"`, or `None` to "
"disable."
